Condiments hold all the fun in the world.

00:06:28.910 --> 00:06:30.750
Daisy, thank you so much.

00:06:30.750 --> 00:06:31.850
You're just the best.

00:06:31.850 --> 00:06:32.841
Thank you, Daisy.

00:06:32.841 --> 00:06:33.710
